WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:49.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:49.760 --> 01:50.840
What do you mean?

3
01:50.920 --> 01:53.280
Thanks for the other night.

4
01:53.360 --> 01:55.560
I waited in line just to get you that viral milk tea.

5
01:55.640 --> 01:56.480
Just showing my respect.

6
01:57.440 --> 01:59.440
Watch what you say. People might get the wrong idea.

7
01:59.520 --> 02:00.600
Let them.

8
02:00.680 --> 02:03.400
As long as you don't misunderstand my total devotion to you.

9
02:03.480 --> 02:04.760
Scram.

10
02:05.440 --> 02:06.640
Fine, I'll go then.

11
02:06.720 --> 02:08.440
I just came back to grab my car anyway.

12
02:08.520 --> 02:10.639
I'll be at the Blue Bay project site all week.

13
02:10.720 --> 02:12.040
Don't miss me too much.

14
02:12.120 --> 02:14.680
You take care of yourself. You're still heartbroken.

15
02:14.760 --> 02:17.240
There are cranes and debris everywhere on site.

16
02:17.320 --> 02:18.760
Don't get distracted and hurt yourself.

17
02:19.360 --> 02:21.600
Hearing that actually made me feel better.

18
02:21.680 --> 02:22.600
You should go.

19
02:23.560 --> 02:24.600
I'm off.

20
02:27.040 --> 02:28.640
-Remember to drink it. -Thanks.

21
02:44.760 --> 02:45.800
Wanna drink it?

22
02:47.800 --> 02:49.560
Here. Zhao Heng bought it. I haven't touched it.

23
02:54.760 --> 02:56.280
What's wrong?

24
02:56.920 --> 02:58.880
Nothing. Didn't sleep well last night.

25
03:00.240 --> 03:01.080
I get it.

26
03:08.640 --> 03:10.920
So what is going on with you and Ye Xinzhi?

27
03:12.280 --> 03:13.360
Nothing.

28
03:14.120 --> 03:15.280
Don't lie to me.

29
03:16.440 --> 03:19.080
You definitely told him you and Yang Rui broke up.

30
03:19.160 --> 03:20.280
How did he react?

31
03:22.480 --> 03:24.280
Missy, do you really need to know?

32
03:25.000 --> 03:27.640
Of course I do. What else would I ask?

33
03:29.800 --> 03:31.880
-Mr. Pi, I have a meeting soon. -Well…

34
03:32.800 --> 03:34.720
I'll send you that file a bit later.

35
03:39.200 --> 03:40.480
Yang Rui.

36
03:45.960 --> 03:47.720
Um, let's start the meeting.

37
04:01.200 --> 04:04.160
During the meeting earlier, I saw you sitting with Xu Chi.

38
04:04.240 --> 04:05.720
Why didn't you two have lunch together?

39
04:07.360 --> 04:08.920
She went to the bank.

40
04:09.000 --> 04:11.480
Shu told me she's under a lot of pressure in your team

41
04:11.560 --> 04:13.200
because you guys work together too efficiently.

42
04:13.280 --> 04:14.200
Sometimes, you're like one person.

43
04:15.320 --> 04:18.240
Just ask what you want to know. No need to beat around the bush.

44
04:19.680 --> 04:20.880
You're too guarded with me.

45
04:20.959 --> 04:22.120
I just want to know

46
04:22.200 --> 04:23.680
how Xu Chi is doing since she moved to your team.

47
04:23.760 --> 04:24.960
She's doing great.

48
04:25.560 --> 04:27.240
Fully focused on work. Not missing you at all.

49
04:30.040 --> 04:31.800
I used to think you two weren't that close.

50
04:31.880 --> 04:32.920
Didn't expect you to defend her like that.

51
04:35.320 --> 04:36.440
We're not close.

52
04:37.040 --> 04:39.600
So, next time you have a question like that,

53
04:39.680 --> 04:40.800
don't bother asking me.

54
04:42.040 --> 04:44.560
No way. Is this Zhao Heng and Xu Chi?

55
04:44.640 --> 04:46.520
I just saw it on Moments.

56
04:46.600 --> 04:49.880
My classmate's bank had a team dinner last Saturday night.

57
04:49.960 --> 04:51.120
Such a big scoop.

58
04:51.200 --> 04:53.520
I had to go gossip right away.

59
04:53.600 --> 04:55.960
My classmate said there was even juicier stuff.

60
04:56.560 --> 04:59.640
Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!

61
05:00.800 --> 05:02.880
Wasn't Zhao Heng pursuing Bu Tianna?

62
05:06.160 --> 05:07.040
What's the gossip?

63
05:07.640 --> 05:09.080
Share it with me too.

64
05:09.160 --> 05:10.400
Well.

65
05:15.920 --> 05:17.920
So juicy.

66
05:20.280 --> 05:22.960
If you two have this much time on your hands,

67
05:23.040 --> 05:25.720
maybe think about how to get promoted, okay?

68
05:28.480 --> 05:29.640
Sorry about that.

69
05:40.200 --> 05:41.520
Have some ice water. Cool down.

70
05:46.400 --> 05:49.160
Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi to Celestial all the time.

71
05:49.240 --> 05:50.120
People at Celestial told me.

72
05:50.960 --> 05:53.200
Back then, Xu Chi and I were still together,

73
05:53.280 --> 05:54.720
but she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

74
05:59.440 --> 06:01.280
Seriously, what is wrong with you?

75
06:01.360 --> 06:03.800
Talking trash about your ex behind her back? No wonder she dumped you!

76
06:04.840 --> 06:07.840
Bu Tianna, don't think you're the only one who gets to be sad.

77
06:07.920 --> 06:09.520
I got cheated on,

78
06:09.600 --> 06:11.560
but just because she's your friend,

79
06:11.640 --> 06:13.320
I'm not even allowed to complain?

80
06:13.400 --> 06:14.840
My feelings for Xu Chi were real.

81
06:14.920 --> 06:16.000
Why can't I say it?

82
06:16.600 --> 06:17.800
Of course you can.

83
06:17.880 --> 06:19.920
There are plenty of people here. Say it wherever you want.

84
06:20.000 --> 06:21.120
Just not in front of me.

85
06:25.400 --> 06:26.320
Quit staring!

86
06:28.400 --> 06:29.320
What a temper.

87
06:39.360 --> 06:42.880
Zhao Heng confessed to Xu Chi on the spot!

88
06:45.840 --> 06:48.320
Zhao Heng used to drive Xu Chi to Celestial all the time.

89
06:48.400 --> 06:49.600
People at Celestial told me.

90
06:50.200 --> 06:52.440
Back then, Xu Chi and I were still together.

91
06:52.520 --> 06:54.120
But she'd rather take Zhao Heng's car.

92
07:03.280 --> 07:04.280
Wang. Wang.

93
07:04.360 --> 07:06.040
Is Mr. Zhao from Maxmise with you?

94
07:07.600 --> 07:09.360
I'm here. What's up?

95
07:09.440 --> 07:10.560
There's a female colleague looking for you.

96
07:10.640 --> 07:12.240
She showed up at the site in all white.

97
07:12.320 --> 07:14.720
Looked like she was in a rush. Just grabbed a hard hat and came in.

98
07:21.440 --> 07:22.720
What are you doing here?

99
07:28.280 --> 07:29.600
I came to apologize.

100
07:29.680 --> 07:31.920
Didn't you say you wanted an apology?

101
07:32.000 --> 07:33.240
I was wrong.

102
07:33.800 --> 07:34.680
I'm sorry.

103
07:37.720 --> 07:39.240
I shouldn't have called you shameless.

104
07:39.320 --> 07:40.840
And I shouldn't have insulted your parents.

105
07:40.920 --> 07:43.320
It's all on me. Is this enough?

106
07:45.280 --> 07:46.360
What do you mean?

107
07:47.760 --> 07:50.160
Still not enough? Fine.

108
07:53.680 --> 07:55.760
What I mean is, can we go back

109
07:55.840 --> 07:57.240
to how things were?

110
07:57.320 --> 07:59.040
You want to hit on me? I'll play along.

111
07:59.120 --> 08:01.040
You want to use me as a stepping stone?

112
08:01.120 --> 08:03.480
I'll play along with that too. I'll hook you up with connections.

113
08:03.560 --> 08:05.520
But can you leave Xu Chi alone?

114
08:05.600 --> 08:06.720
Just come at me.

115
08:06.800 --> 08:09.000
Don't hurt her to get back at me, okay?

116
08:09.800 --> 08:11.120
What are you even talking about?

117
08:11.200 --> 08:12.240
That's still not enough?

118
08:15.200 --> 08:17.360
Let me tell you, I don't have that much patience.

119
08:17.440 --> 08:18.520
Xu Chi is too naive.

120
08:18.600 --> 08:20.920
She broke up with Yang Rui for Ye Xinzhi on a whim, and now look.

121
08:21.000 --> 08:23.640
Ye Xinzhi left her hanging. She's already a mess.

122
08:23.720 --> 08:25.440
She can't handle all your sweet talk.

123
08:25.520 --> 08:27.240
I know exactly how powerful your tricks are.

124
08:27.320 --> 08:28.680
You're way too much.

125
08:28.760 --> 08:30.000
One day you're driving her around.

126
08:30.080 --> 08:31.480
The next day you're buying gifts and milk tea.

127
08:31.560 --> 08:33.600
Then it's all sweet talk.

128
08:33.679 --> 08:34.919
Isn't it money you're after?

129
08:35.000 --> 08:37.039
You just want to use her and hurt her!

130
08:37.120 --> 08:38.720
It's not like that. Calm down.

131
08:38.799 --> 08:40.280
This is me being calm!

132
08:40.360 --> 08:42.280
The whole company knows you two were drinking together.

133
08:42.360 --> 08:44.360
Even people at Celestial Insurance know.

134
08:44.440 --> 08:48.280
Zhao Heng, you don't have to go this far just to get back at me!

135
09:15.080 --> 09:18.120
What is wrong with you? Are you crazy?

136
09:22.360 --> 09:23.920
Didn't you tell me to come at you?

137
09:27.400 --> 09:28.400
Are you calm now?

138
09:28.480 --> 09:29.920
Can you listen to me now?

139
09:33.040 --> 09:35.800
I don't know what you heard or saw out there,

140
09:35.880 --> 09:37.400
or what you misunderstood.

141
09:37.480 --> 09:39.400
I just want to say one thing.

142
09:39.480 --> 09:42.520
Xu Chi and I are just friends. Like buddies.

143
09:43.200 --> 09:45.280
I've called her Ms. Xu, and I've called her Chi.

144
09:45.360 --> 09:47.120
That Saturday, I was in a bad mood after arguing with you.

145
09:47.200 --> 09:49.360
I ran into her at the office. I asked her to drink with me.

146
09:50.520 --> 09:51.520
Then I drank too much.

147
09:51.600 --> 09:53.120
She dumped me in a cab

148
09:53.200 --> 09:54.240
and sent me home.

149
09:54.320 --> 09:57.240
Then the next day, I wanted to thank her, so I bought her a milk tea.

150
09:57.320 --> 09:58.920
-That's it. -Really?

151
10:00.160 --> 10:01.000
Yes.

152
10:03.560 --> 10:04.720
Then…

153
10:07.240 --> 10:08.440
Then… I'm fine now.

154
10:09.040 --> 10:10.080
But I'm not.

155
10:12.200 --> 10:14.560
I've realized you really get me.

156
10:16.600 --> 10:18.120
A gorgeous woman standing right here.

157
10:18.200 --> 10:21.160
She's got money, a fancy car, and a big house.

158
10:21.240 --> 10:24.160
You think I'd just change my life goals over a fight with you?

159
10:24.240 --> 10:26.920
-Do I look like that kind of guy? -Okay, okay. I get it.

160
10:27.800 --> 10:30.440
How can you just take advantage and walk away?

161
10:37.080 --> 10:38.960
Hey, aren't you trying to pursue me?

162
10:39.040 --> 10:41.240
Then you have to get used to my mood swings

163
10:41.320 --> 10:42.640
and being used and tossed aside. Got it?

164
10:45.360 --> 10:46.680
I'm really happy you came to see me today.

165
11:02.640 --> 11:05.000
God, what a dump this place is.

166
11:07.760 --> 11:09.000
Tianna!

167
11:15.200 --> 11:16.520
That was way too short.

168
11:16.600 --> 11:18.120
Next time, let's make it longer.

169
11:18.200 --> 11:20.520
And let's try it without the hard hats.

170
11:39.920 --> 11:41.200
-Hello? -Where are you?

171
11:41.280 --> 11:43.160
How come you're not at the office? And you didn't get back to me on WeChat.

172
11:43.840 --> 11:44.880
What's wrong?

173
11:44.960 --> 11:45.760
Something happened with the Celestial project.

174
11:45.840 --> 11:48.280
Their board secretary and legal team just went straight to Mr. Pi.

175
11:48.360 --> 11:49.560
No idea what they said.

176
11:49.640 --> 11:51.440
But Mr. Pi came out and announced the whole project is on hold.

177
11:53.000 --> 11:55.200
Xu Chi. Xu Chi.

178
11:55.280 --> 11:57.320
Sha Sha wants you in her office. Right now.

179
12:05.360 --> 12:06.720
The recording is standard procedure.

180
12:06.800 --> 12:08.360
Hope you don't mind.

181
12:08.880 --> 12:11.160
Also, the Compliance Department will take

182
12:11.240 --> 12:13.160
your work laptop for the investigation.

183
12:13.240 --> 12:16.840
Under your contract with the company, all of this is legal and reasonable.

184
12:16.920 --> 12:19.040
Investigation? Is something wrong with me?

185
12:19.640 --> 12:21.440
Everyone on the Celestial project team is being investigated.

186
12:21.520 --> 12:22.720
I need to ask you a few questions.

187
12:24.520 --> 12:26.200
First, why did you apply

188
12:26.280 --> 12:27.880
to transfer out of the Celestial project's IT team?

189
12:29.320 --> 12:32.200
Because Yang Rui and I broke up.

190
12:33.520 --> 12:36.520
We both felt it wasn't appropriate to stay in the same team.

191
12:36.600 --> 12:39.560
-But he's the team lead, so I… -Why did you two break up?

192
12:39.640 --> 12:42.200
Why did you fight before the breakup?

193
12:45.520 --> 12:47.920
These all touch on private matters. You don't have to answer.

194
12:48.000 --> 12:49.560
But that could very likely

195
12:49.640 --> 12:52.000
affect how the company views this situation.

196
12:52.600 --> 12:54.640
We just weren't compatible. No fights.

197
12:55.240 --> 12:57.320
Actually, we weren't together that long.

198
12:57.400 --> 13:00.240
Once we realized it wasn't working, we talked it out pretty quickly.

199
13:00.320 --> 13:01.280
Okay.

200
13:01.840 --> 13:04.320
Was the detailed reform plan

201
13:04.400 --> 13:06.520
for Celestial's IT Department done by you?

202
13:06.600 --> 13:07.640
The draft was.

203
13:07.720 --> 13:10.240
About 60% of the work.

204
13:10.320 --> 13:12.000
The other 40% was done by Yang Rui.

205
13:15.640 --> 13:16.880
Is there something wrong with that plan?

206
13:19.920 --> 13:22.160
Highlight everything you worked on.

207
13:22.240 --> 13:23.320
Try to recall as thoroughly as you can

208
13:23.400 --> 13:26.080
because this will be cross-checked

209
13:26.160 --> 13:28.080
against your emails and the investigation results

210
13:28.160 --> 13:29.400
on Yang Rui.

211
13:40.280 --> 13:42.440
Also, you need to specify how many times

212
13:42.520 --> 13:44.840
you met with Mr. Sun

213
13:45.360 --> 13:47.080
and what you discussed.

214
14:24.440 --> 14:25.320
Meet me on the rooftop.

215
14:27.120 --> 14:28.200
Did they call you in?

216
14:29.560 --> 14:30.760
Talked for ten minutes.

217
14:30.840 --> 14:32.080
Lu Le talked to me.

218
14:32.680 --> 14:35.880
She just asked about your general work situation in our team.

219
14:35.960 --> 14:38.960
When you didn't come out for so long, I figured something went wrong.

220
14:39.040 --> 14:40.280
So I asked around

221
14:40.360 --> 14:42.880
with people at Celestial and some of my elders,

222
14:42.960 --> 14:45.520
-and I put together a rough theory. -What is it?

223
14:47.600 --> 14:49.120
MA KE might have made a shady deal

224
14:49.200 --> 14:51.320
with Director Peng from Celestial's IT Department.

225
14:52.080 --> 14:54.280
The plan we made changed

226
14:54.360 --> 14:56.120
the system architecture for Celestial's IT Department,

227
14:56.200 --> 14:57.360
but their IT Department

228
14:57.440 --> 14:59.640
doesn't have the ability to do it on their own.

229
14:59.720 --> 15:00.560
They'd have to outsource.

230
15:01.160 --> 15:02.880
And that outsourcing is tied to Director Peng.

231
15:04.000 --> 15:06.000
But the one who talked to me and Yang Rui that day was Mr. Sun.

232
15:06.080 --> 15:09.400
Mr. Sun is the Deputy Director. Director Peng is the one in charge.

233
15:09.480 --> 15:12.080
That day, Director Peng had a last-minute business trip,

234
15:12.160 --> 15:13.480
so Mr. Sun filled in for him.

235
15:14.440 --> 15:15.600
Our SOA works perfectly fine,

236
15:15.680 --> 15:17.480
and you want us to just switch to microservices?

237
15:17.560 --> 15:18.400
And get it done in three months?

238
15:18.480 --> 15:19.960
Do you have any idea how much work that is?

239
15:20.040 --> 15:21.600
This transformation has to happen.

240
15:21.680 --> 15:22.680
So please make sure

241
15:22.760 --> 15:24.680
to fully cooperate with us on the redevelopment.

242
15:24.760 --> 15:26.480
Ma Ke said to put it on hold.

243
15:26.560 --> 15:27.640
He'll handle it.

244
15:27.720 --> 15:29.560
Can you not go off on your own like this?

245
15:29.640 --> 15:31.120
-Yang Rui? -You figured it out too?

246
15:36.400 --> 15:37.240
Be honest with me.

247
15:37.320 --> 15:39.520
Were you involved in this? How much do you know?

248
15:40.120 --> 15:42.200
-I don't know anything. -It's not too late if you tell me now.

249
15:42.280 --> 15:44.080
Even if I have to beg my dad,

250
15:44.160 --> 15:45.280
I'd know

251
15:45.360 --> 15:46.520
how to get you out.

252
15:46.600 --> 15:48.600
How could I possibly do something like that?

253
15:48.680 --> 15:50.880
Ye Xinzhi drilled it into me so many times.

254
15:50.960 --> 15:52.240
No conflicts of interest. No kickbacks.

255
15:52.320 --> 15:53.800
That's the most basic code of conduct for consultants.

256
15:53.880 --> 15:55.400
I could never do something like that.

257
15:59.320 --> 16:00.480
Good.

258
16:00.560 --> 16:02.080
I heard Mr. Sun kicked up a fuss

259
16:02.160 --> 16:05.200
because your team's project was way too ridiculous.

260
16:05.280 --> 16:06.560
Higher-ups just wanted to calm things down,

261
16:06.640 --> 16:07.680
so they had the Integrity & Compliance Department

262
16:07.760 --> 16:08.960
go through the motions.

263
16:09.040 --> 16:10.720
But after just two days,

264
16:10.800 --> 16:12.880
they found the problem between Ma Ke and Director Peng.

265
16:13.880 --> 16:15.640
No wonder Yang Rui told me to keep quiet during the pitch,

266
16:16.520 --> 16:17.560
acted so pushy

267
16:17.640 --> 16:19.680
when presenting the plan, and set such a tight deadline.

268
16:20.280 --> 16:21.240
By the way,

269
16:21.320 --> 16:22.760
Mr. Sun didn't agree back then.

270
16:22.840 --> 16:23.880
And Ma Ke called Yang Rui,

271
16:23.960 --> 16:25.760
told me to stay out of it, and said he'd handle it.

272
16:27.360 --> 16:28.840
Let me be blunt.

273
16:29.760 --> 16:32.720
Yang Rui broke up with you so early. Didn't that

274
16:33.880 --> 16:35.320
raise any flags?

275
16:35.960 --> 16:37.800
He must've known that after you broke up,

276
16:37.880 --> 16:39.560
you wouldn't be on the same team anymore.

277
16:42.840 --> 16:44.160
Because I thought

278
16:44.240 --> 16:46.360
the IT architecture overhaul plan was way too ridiculous.

279
16:46.440 --> 16:47.920
I sided with Mr. Sun.

280
16:48.520 --> 16:49.640
So they felt I was in the way.

281
16:51.360 --> 16:53.160
Yang Rui is Ma Ke's right-hand man.

282
16:53.800 --> 16:55.560
You're the one who told me that.

283
16:57.600 --> 16:58.920
No way.

284
16:59.000 --> 17:00.840
Yang Rui can't be that kind of person.

285
17:03.320 --> 17:05.839
This kind of thing happens. I've been through it too.

286
17:05.920 --> 17:07.680
That's just how Ma Ke is.

287
17:07.760 --> 17:09.400
He used to be pretty good at his job.

288
17:09.480 --> 17:11.480
But over the last couple of years, with more going on at home,

289
17:11.560 --> 17:13.079
his focus hasn't been on work.

290
17:13.160 --> 17:15.079
He often takes credit for our work.

291
17:15.680 --> 17:17.040
But he's good at networking.

292
17:17.119 --> 17:20.599
Most of Celestial Insurance's projects came from him drinking with clients.

293
17:21.599 --> 17:24.000
Wait. Yang Rui told me

294
17:24.079 --> 17:25.599
Ma Ke's been short on money these past few years.

295
17:25.680 --> 17:27.880
That's why he drank himself sick to land the Celestial deal.

296
17:28.480 --> 17:29.480
So…

297
17:30.080 --> 17:31.520
I'll go clear the air with Sha Sha.

298
17:31.600 --> 17:32.800
Wait.

299
17:32.880 --> 17:34.000
Okay, alright.

300
17:35.880 --> 17:38.480
Calm down. Don't do anything right now.

301
17:39.240 --> 17:41.760
Plus, this is a joint investigation by Celestial and Maxmise.

302
17:41.840 --> 17:43.840
Both are top-tier companies. You won't be wrongly accused.

303
17:44.520 --> 17:46.240
But I saw the news before.

304
17:46.320 --> 17:47.880
In 2014, Anxinda had a similar case.

305
17:47.960 --> 17:50.000
Several people ended up criminally detained.

306
17:50.080 --> 17:51.000
Do you think Yang Rui…

307
17:51.080 --> 17:53.400
Okay, forget about him.

308
17:53.480 --> 17:55.120
All that matters is that you're okay.

309
17:55.200 --> 17:57.080
Mr. Pi and Sha Sha both thought highly of you before.

310
17:57.160 --> 18:00.200
Once they confirm you had nothing to do with this,

311
18:00.280 --> 18:01.480
they'll definitely protect you.

312
18:01.560 --> 18:04.360
But this has gotten so big.

313
18:04.440 --> 18:06.840
And insurance is the most sensitive sector in finance.

314
18:07.680 --> 18:09.320
If they can't get to the bottom of it, will they sacrifice the innocent

315
18:09.400 --> 18:11.200
to protect their reputation?

316
18:11.280 --> 18:12.480
I'm just a junior analyst.

317
18:12.560 --> 18:15.440
To them, I'm not irreplaceable.

318
18:29.120 --> 18:31.240
BUSINESS NEEDS ASSESSMENT PHASE APRIL 6–8

319
18:31.320 --> 18:34.960
CELESTIAL INSURANCE

320
19:46.520 --> 19:49.000
I think Xu Chi's proposal is clean.

321
19:57.600 --> 20:00.840
I hope you understand how serious this is.

322
20:02.040 --> 20:04.920
Celestial is getting ready to bring in economic crimes investigators.

323
20:05.840 --> 20:06.920
I have a clear conscience.

324
20:07.000 --> 20:08.520
I'll fully cooperate with any investigation.

325
20:09.920 --> 20:11.560
Investigations take time.

326
20:11.640 --> 20:13.920
So the company wants you to cooperate with an off-site audit.

327
20:14.520 --> 20:15.720
What does that mean?

328
20:16.240 --> 20:17.080
Am I getting fired?

329
20:17.160 --> 20:18.840
No, just off-site.

330
20:19.440 --> 20:21.600
To make sure the investigation isn't interfered with,

331
20:21.680 --> 20:23.440
you'll need to take a temporary leave.

332
20:24.040 --> 20:25.640
If you're proven innocent,

333
20:25.720 --> 20:26.840
you'll come back to work.

334
20:29.960 --> 20:31.480
Besides me,

335
20:31.560 --> 20:32.920
will there be anyone else on leave for the audit?

336
20:33.600 --> 20:35.520
Yang Rui, Ma Ke, and me.

337
20:37.040 --> 20:41.160
Because you were suddenly brought in by me

338
20:41.240 --> 20:42.760
long after the project started.

339
20:42.840 --> 20:44.040
That doesn't make sense.

340
20:47.480 --> 20:48.640
Sorry I dragged you into this.

341
20:50.880 --> 20:52.040
Then…

342
20:53.000 --> 20:55.880
How long will I be on leave?

343
20:56.480 --> 20:57.280
About a month for now.

344
20:58.200 --> 21:00.800
People from Integrity & Compliance are already waiting for you at your desk.

345
21:01.400 --> 21:03.280
After you finish with them, you'd better leave the office right away.

346
21:04.160 --> 21:05.000
Don't worry.

347
21:05.080 --> 21:07.680
During the audit, your salary and benefits won't be affected.

348
21:10.320 --> 21:11.280
Okay.

349
21:21.800 --> 21:23.600
Ms. Sha, do you believe me?

350
21:26.400 --> 21:27.600
I only believe in facts.

351
21:42.240 --> 21:43.280
-How did it go? -How did it go?

352
21:50.080 --> 21:52.400
I'm on immediate leave. Off-site audit.

353
21:57.400 --> 21:58.640
Even Sha Sha got dragged

354
22:00.200 --> 22:01.240
into this because of me.

355
22:01.840 --> 22:02.880
It's fine.

356
22:03.480 --> 22:04.440
Listen.

357
22:04.960 --> 22:07.320
Just take your leave. I'll keep an eye on things here.

358
22:07.920 --> 22:09.040
I won't let you get screwed over.

359
22:09.120 --> 22:11.400
So even you think I'm doomed now?

360
22:13.200 --> 22:16.200
No. It's alright. Don't overthink it.

361
22:23.880 --> 22:24.720
And your badge.

362
22:25.400 --> 22:28.080
-Can she come back? -God knows.

363
22:30.240 --> 22:32.160
I used to be jealous of her.

364
22:32.240 --> 22:34.680
After all, she got promoted the fastest out of all of us.

365
22:35.400 --> 22:36.240
And now…

366
23:00.720 --> 23:01.760
What are you…?

367
23:02.840 --> 23:03.800
Lin, you're back at work.

368
23:06.920 --> 23:07.960
Welcome back.

369
23:16.840 --> 23:18.200
Just stay put at the office for now.

370
23:18.280 --> 23:19.360
I'll go.

371
23:28.440 --> 23:29.400
Chi.

372
23:30.240 --> 23:32.440
Come grace my crappy car with your presence.

373
23:35.120 --> 23:36.080
Let's go.

374
23:53.280 --> 23:55.400
Hey, stop being upset.

375
23:55.480 --> 23:57.320
If it were me, I'd be over the moon.

376
23:57.400 --> 23:58.800
Come on, paid leave.

377
23:58.880 --> 24:01.640
A once-in-a-lifetime chance. Make the most of it.

378
24:01.720 --> 24:03.440
When you make partner someday,

379
24:03.520 --> 24:04.960
you can brag to your team

380
24:05.040 --> 24:07.120
about this rare break.

381
24:09.640 --> 24:11.360
You don't need to comfort me.

382
24:11.440 --> 24:12.480
I can handle it.

383
24:13.160 --> 24:15.920
It's not that far anyway. You really didn't have to drive me.

384
24:16.760 --> 24:18.360
It's not just for you.

385
24:19.560 --> 24:22.280
Tianna will be glad to hear about this.

386
24:24.680 --> 24:26.640
I just saw you two whispering together.

387
24:26.720 --> 24:28.160
Didn't look like fighting at all.

388
24:28.240 --> 24:29.080
Come clean.

389
24:29.160 --> 24:31.640
What happened when I wasn't around?

390
24:33.040 --> 24:34.160
Nothing.

391
24:34.880 --> 24:37.400
Anyway, thanks.

392
24:37.480 --> 24:38.520
You're thanking me?

393
24:39.440 --> 24:41.160
You remember that night I got drunk, right?

394
24:41.240 --> 24:42.200
You put me in a cab.

395
24:43.280 --> 24:44.720
Someone took a photo.

396
24:44.800 --> 24:46.960
Tianna saw it, and immediately drove

397
24:47.040 --> 24:49.200
to the construction site in her all-white outfit.

398
24:49.280 --> 24:51.560
She grilled me. "Why did you make a move on her?"

399
24:52.160 --> 24:54.760
She told me to stop messing with you and to come at her instead.

400
24:56.240 --> 24:57.600
So you two are the real couple,

401
24:57.680 --> 24:59.680
and I'm just some cheap side piece?

402
25:02.040 --> 25:02.880
Glad you know.

403
25:04.800 --> 25:06.200
Hey, what are you talking about?

404
25:07.280 --> 25:12.280
What I mean is, she was actually jealous. She's too stubborn to admit it.

405
25:12.360 --> 25:14.920
So she used you as her excuse to come talk to me.

406
25:15.000 --> 25:17.680
After I explained everything to her, it was all good.

407
25:17.760 --> 25:18.960
She was happy.

408
25:19.040 --> 25:20.160
Even though

409
25:20.240 --> 25:22.320
I still don't have an official title, the second you got into trouble,

410
25:22.400 --> 25:24.400
she called me right away

411
25:24.480 --> 25:25.720
to figure out what to do.

412
25:26.760 --> 25:27.840
Got it.

413
25:27.920 --> 25:30.280
Then keep at it. Make it official soon.

414
25:31.800 --> 25:33.000
You bet.

415
25:53.440 --> 25:56.200
I saw you at the café on Saturday.

416
25:56.280 --> 25:58.440
Can you explain why you were there?

417
25:58.520 --> 26:00.320
And he was there too.

418
26:00.400 --> 26:03.280
The two of us were having coffee and afternoon tea together.

419
26:04.520 --> 26:10.520
Are you two deeply involved in our company's business dealings?

420
26:10.600 --> 26:14.800
Tell me when and where you met Mr. Sun.

421
26:14.880 --> 26:16.120
The more detailed, the better.

422
26:16.200 --> 26:17.520
Have you worked together before?

423
26:17.600 --> 26:20.160
Why does the IT Department want to replace the entire system?

424
26:20.240 --> 26:21.760
Give me a proper explanation.

425
26:21.840 --> 26:23.160
Be honest with me.

426
26:23.680 --> 26:25.080
Were you involved in this?

427
26:25.160 --> 26:26.080
How much do you know?

428
26:26.160 --> 26:27.720
I only believe in facts.

429
26:28.520 --> 26:30.600
I want to hear your honest answer.

430
26:31.200 --> 26:32.800
Can you explain why you were there?

431
26:32.880 --> 26:34.320
Were you involved in this?

432
26:34.400 --> 26:36.880
Why does the IT Department want to replace the entire system?

433
26:36.960 --> 26:38.320
I only believe in facts.

434
26:38.400 --> 26:39.920
Can you explain why you were there?

435
26:40.000 --> 26:41.440
Were you involved in this?

436
26:41.520 --> 26:43.960
Why does the IT Department want to replace the entire system?

437
26:44.040 --> 26:45.800
I only believe in facts.

438
26:50.800 --> 26:53.160
Miss Xu, are you in the room?

439
26:54.200 --> 26:55.560
Please answer.

440
26:55.640 --> 26:57.960
Or I'm coming in with the spare key card.

441
26:58.920 --> 27:01.680
Miss Xu, I'm opening the door!

442
27:06.720 --> 27:07.680
No, no…

443
27:13.040 --> 27:14.040
Are you okay?

444
27:20.400 --> 27:21.800
Thanks. I'll take it from here.

445
27:21.880 --> 27:23.840
Could you grab me two sports drinks?

446
27:23.920 --> 27:26.360
-Sure. -No, no need. I don't need to drink. I…

447
27:26.440 --> 27:27.560
Don't talk for now.

448
27:35.640 --> 27:36.720
Eat this.

449
27:38.520 --> 27:40.000
I'm really fine. I'm not hungry.

450
27:40.760 --> 27:41.960
Take it.

451
27:44.120 --> 27:46.800
The front desk said you haven't left your room in 48 hours.

452
27:46.880 --> 27:47.760
What have you eaten?

453
27:51.040 --> 27:52.040
I…

454
27:54.760 --> 27:56.440
I've just been sleeping.

455
27:57.040 --> 27:58.080
Look at yourself.

456
27:58.160 --> 27:59.680
You say you've been sleeping?

457
27:59.760 --> 28:01.280
Are you lying to me or yourself?

458
28:08.560 --> 28:10.480
You know about the Celestial thing?

459
28:12.320 --> 28:13.600
The consulting world is small.

460
28:14.120 --> 28:16.200
The moment I heard it, I called Sha Sha.

461
28:16.280 --> 28:18.360
And you? Gone MIA again.

462
28:18.440 --> 28:20.920
Not replying to WeChat. Phone off.

463
28:21.720 --> 28:24.600
I dropped everything and flew back from Shanghai overnight.

464
28:24.680 --> 28:27.040
Then we hit a thunderstorm and had an emergency landing in Jinan.

465
28:27.120 --> 28:28.960
I took the 7 a.m. high-speed train to get here.

466
28:29.040 --> 28:30.040
I was worried about you.

467
28:30.640 --> 28:32.120
You came back just for me?

468
28:32.200 --> 28:35.080
Of course. I didn't even drop my luggage off at home.

469
28:47.720 --> 28:48.880
Go ahead.

470
28:50.200 --> 28:52.840
Whether you want to chew me out or laugh at me, I'm ready.

471
28:53.640 --> 28:54.480
Why would I laugh at you?

472
28:57.160 --> 28:58.280
Because I'm stupid.

473
28:58.880 --> 29:01.000
To bury a secret thought I couldn't share with anyone,

474
29:01.080 --> 29:02.520
I randomly got a boyfriend.

475
29:02.600 --> 29:04.920
Then randomly broke up and got dragged into this.

476
29:05.560 --> 29:07.360
Now I might even lose my job.

477
29:08.640 --> 29:09.880
My mom's old apartment

478
29:10.480 --> 29:13.760
and my big career dreams could all be down the drain.

479
29:17.320 --> 29:19.040
You said you wouldn't laugh at me.

480
29:20.520 --> 29:21.760
I'm not laughing at you.

481
29:22.920 --> 29:25.240
I'm happy about that secret thought

482
29:25.320 --> 29:27.200
you couldn't share with anyone.

483
29:28.080 --> 29:29.960
-Stop making assumptions. -I'm not.

484
29:36.200 --> 29:39.240
By the way, did you see all those WeChat messages

485
29:39.320 --> 29:40.320
I sent you?

486
29:40.920 --> 29:42.320
Why didn't you reply?

487
29:42.400 --> 29:43.640
That picture…

488
29:45.400 --> 29:48.480
I… I didn't know how to reply.

489
29:49.200 --> 29:51.080
You told me you were on a business trip somewhere.

490
29:51.160 --> 29:54.880
Anything I said back would've felt weird, right?

491
29:56.400 --> 29:58.160
Not those. I mean the picture.

492
29:58.800 --> 29:59.640
What about it?

493
30:00.440 --> 30:01.760
You… Look again.

494
30:03.880 --> 30:05.800
Seriously. Just look.

495
30:14.200 --> 30:15.600
"The moonlight is beautiful tonight."

496
30:15.680 --> 30:16.760
What about it?

497
30:21.080 --> 30:22.280
You don't get it?

498
30:23.040 --> 30:24.160
-What… -What am I

499
30:24.240 --> 30:25.680
supposed to get?

500
30:25.760 --> 30:28.560
Wait… I… I specifically picked that one. You…

501
30:30.320 --> 30:33.560
I specially picked that one. I figured young people would get it.

502
30:40.560 --> 30:42.320
People online say "The moonlight is beautiful tonight"

503
30:42.400 --> 30:43.920
is another way of saying "I love you."

504
30:54.960 --> 30:56.240
Is that okay?

505
30:58.720 --> 31:01.760
THE MOONLIGHT IS BEAUTIFUL TONIGHT

506
31:10.720 --> 31:11.920
And the breeze is gentle.

507
31:15.400 --> 31:16.880
I wanted to take it slow.

508
31:18.040 --> 31:19.200
But

509
31:19.760 --> 31:21.280
I'm scared to let go now.

510
31:21.360 --> 31:22.960
Because once I do…

511
31:33.120 --> 31:35.720
So, are we still stuck in the grey between black and white?

512
31:38.880 --> 31:39.920
It's red.

513
31:41.920 --> 31:43.040
The red of my heart racing for you.

514
32:14.280 --> 32:15.280
DU

515
32:25.040 --> 32:28.040
Oh no. I've got a meeting with Du soon.

516
32:28.120 --> 32:29.560
-I gotta go. -Go ahead.

517
32:29.640 --> 32:32.200
Why don't you come help me out?

518
32:32.280 --> 32:33.280
You're on leave anyway.

519
32:33.360 --> 32:35.400
The project with Wen Ruosen is wrapping up.

520
32:35.920 --> 32:37.880
With you there, it'd be easier on me.

521
32:41.280 --> 32:43.160
Is that okay with my situation?

522
32:44.280 --> 32:45.560
Should be fine.

523
32:46.080 --> 32:49.120
Besides, doing a little private work for your boyfriend…

524
33:00.720 --> 33:01.760
What did you say?

525
33:03.880 --> 33:05.160
I said

526
33:06.000 --> 33:07.760
you're on leave anyway.

527
33:08.720 --> 33:11.560
Doing a little private work for your boyfriend should be fine.

528
33:13.200 --> 33:15.760
If you're really worried, you can go ask Sha Sha.

529
33:16.360 --> 33:19.160
Get some rest for now. See you at the apartment at eight tonight.

530
33:21.480 --> 33:22.440
I'm heading out.

531
33:28.280 --> 33:29.400
Wait.

532
33:41.680 --> 33:42.840
You…

533
33:44.200 --> 33:46.440
You didn't suddenly say all this

534
33:47.640 --> 33:48.800
just to comfort me, did you?

535
33:50.280 --> 33:51.120
Do I look like that kind of guy?

536
33:58.880 --> 34:00.160
I always thought

537
34:01.200 --> 34:03.160
a mature guy like you

538
34:04.000 --> 34:05.600
wouldn't go for a kid like me.

539
34:10.000 --> 34:12.520
I kept saying

540
34:13.440 --> 34:15.000
we were just master and protege.

541
34:15.840 --> 34:18.600
Because I was terrified you'd look down on my past.

542
34:20.800 --> 34:22.960
Because love makes people insecure.

543
34:24.199 --> 34:25.040
It makes me a coward.

544
34:34.040 --> 34:35.880
I've got plenty of courage. Let me share some with you.

545
34:38.920 --> 34:41.400
Okay. Go to your meeting. Careful.

546
34:55.679 --> 34:57.640
The moonlight is beautiful tonight!

547
35:00.640 --> 35:01.880
And the breeze is gentle.

548
35:06.960 --> 35:09.120
DELIVERIES, PLEASE LEAVE AT DOOR TABLE ON THE LEFT

549
35:18.040 --> 35:19.720
NO ONE APPLAUDS

550
35:19.800 --> 35:22.160
Our project has already entered the delivery phase.

551
35:22.240 --> 35:23.800
The highlight of this week's delivery

552
35:23.880 --> 35:25.480
is the overseas business matrix system

553
35:25.560 --> 35:26.960
we designed for Bolo Culture.

554
35:27.720 --> 35:28.880
Lin Long is the expert on this.

555
35:29.480 --> 35:31.080
For the next two days,

556
35:31.160 --> 35:32.200
she'll be conducting

557
35:32.280 --> 35:34.680
an overseas business management training for the executive team.

558
35:39.400 --> 35:41.400
We meet again, everyone.

559
35:44.640 --> 35:46.480
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

560
36:10.920 --> 36:12.280
What a coincidence.

561
36:12.360 --> 36:15.280
It was Ms. Lin last time too, and everything went wrong then too.

562
36:15.360 --> 36:16.840
Think she'll pull it off this time?

563
36:16.920 --> 36:18.520
I don't know if she's up for it,

564
36:18.600 --> 36:21.720
but she's been at it forever and can't even get the screen to work.

565
36:21.800 --> 36:23.360
If it were me, I'd have fired her ages ago.

566
36:25.520 --> 36:27.080
If you're gonna gossip, at least keep it down.

567
36:27.160 --> 36:29.080
-Yes. -Aren't you afraid of being overheard?

568
36:30.160 --> 36:31.480
Let me tell you,

569
36:31.560 --> 36:33.200
there are plenty of Maxmise people here now.

570
36:33.280 --> 36:34.880
They bill by the hour.

571
36:34.960 --> 36:36.880
If they hear you and get pissed off

572
36:36.960 --> 36:38.400
and drag things out an hour or two every day,

573
36:38.480 --> 36:39.840
who's paying for that?

574
36:44.280 --> 36:46.360
Your snack? I'll buy you a new pack.

575
36:47.560 --> 36:49.720
-Alright. Finish up and get back. -Okay.

576
36:52.560 --> 36:53.400
I'll buy you a new pack.

577
36:54.240 --> 36:55.360
BOLO CULTURE OVERSEAS BUSINESS MATRIX SYSTEM

578
36:55.440 --> 36:56.520
Finally.

579
36:56.600 --> 36:58.520
I'll go tell them to come in for the meeting.

580
36:58.600 --> 37:01.200
Sit down and rest. I'll have Ou Lizheng get them for you.

581
37:01.280 --> 37:02.640
No need to help me. I can do it myself.

582
37:02.720 --> 37:03.920
I'm not trying to help you.

583
37:04.680 --> 37:07.120
I just need you at your best, so you don't embarrass me.

584
37:07.920 --> 37:09.880
You know what? I asked to have you assigned to me

585
37:09.960 --> 37:10.920
when you came back.

586
37:11.600 --> 37:12.600
I just wanted to see

587
37:12.680 --> 37:15.000
how thrilling it feels to have my old rival

588
37:15.080 --> 37:15.920
working under me.

589
37:17.400 --> 37:18.280
Not as thrilling

590
37:18.360 --> 37:20.240
as the feeling of kicking my ex-husband to the curb.

591
37:21.240 --> 37:22.600
Not bad. You've got some fight.

592
37:22.680 --> 37:23.680
You know what?

593
37:23.760 --> 37:25.920
These past few months have been pretty lonely

594
37:26.000 --> 37:27.080
without anyone giving me pushback.

595
37:32.320 --> 37:34.960
-What? -I want to thank you.

596
37:35.040 --> 37:36.720
Thank you for letting me back on this project.

597
37:38.120 --> 37:39.680
Cut it out.

598
37:39.760 --> 37:42.160
The guys at the office are just waiting for you to fail.

599
37:42.240 --> 37:44.160
I'm not letting them steal my exclusive rights.

600
37:44.920 --> 37:47.760
You've got half an hour. I'll hold down the fort for you.

601
37:51.840 --> 37:52.840
Go touch up your lipstick.

602
38:21.640 --> 38:24.000
Why did you bring so much makeup to work here?

603
38:24.080 --> 38:26.160
You look the same with or without it.

604
38:26.240 --> 38:27.080
Why are you sneaking up on people like that?

605
38:27.160 --> 38:28.400
I was just…

606
38:32.040 --> 38:34.360
Are you fully recovered? What's the rush to get back to work?

607
38:35.360 --> 38:37.560
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Shen. I've been fine for a while now.

608
38:38.960 --> 38:40.360
Who are you kidding?

609
38:40.440 --> 38:41.760
Look at you.

610
38:41.840 --> 38:43.120
You're thin as a rail.

611
38:43.880 --> 38:44.800
Want some spicy strips?

612
38:46.120 --> 38:48.320
-Mr. Shen, let's just go to the meeting-- -Hold on.

613
38:49.080 --> 38:50.400
I'm the client.

614
38:50.480 --> 38:53.440
I'm paying you for consulting. I'm not in a rush, so why are you?

615
38:55.120 --> 38:56.280
I just wanted to say,

616
38:56.360 --> 38:58.720
if you haven't fully recovered, don't rush back to work.

617
38:59.520 --> 39:00.800
Why push yourself?

618
39:00.880 --> 39:02.920
Just wing it during the training later.

619
39:03.680 --> 39:05.080
Just send us the slides afterward.

620
39:06.600 --> 39:08.120
Mr. Shen, do you think

621
39:08.200 --> 39:10.320
I've been coasting in consulting

622
39:10.400 --> 39:11.920
all these years?

623
39:12.000 --> 39:13.920
I'll admit I wasn't professional enough before.

624
39:14.000 --> 39:16.840
That's because my hormones were out of whack during pregnancy.

625
39:16.920 --> 39:18.120
But now that I'm back,

626
39:18.200 --> 39:19.480
I'm going to do it right.

627
39:20.280 --> 39:23.920
I was just expressing my concern for you.

628
39:24.720 --> 39:26.640
Purely out of sympathy.

629
39:26.720 --> 39:27.720
Sympathy?

630
39:27.800 --> 39:30.440
When you fail, do you want people to comfort you with sympathy?

631
39:32.400 --> 39:33.680
What's wrong with you?

632
39:34.320 --> 39:36.120
I try to be nice, and you throw it back in my face.

633
39:46.840 --> 39:48.840
-What? -I wanted to thank you

634
39:48.920 --> 39:51.680
for taking me to the clinic after my car accident

635
39:51.760 --> 39:53.040
and for

636
39:53.120 --> 39:55.080
checking on me just now.

637
39:56.680 --> 39:57.520
And this.

638
39:59.600 --> 40:01.000
Xu Chi brought this to me before.

639
40:01.600 --> 40:03.560
She said you specifically asked for it. And she passed along that message.

640
40:04.600 --> 40:06.560
"A rebirth through hardship and better days ahead."

641
40:06.640 --> 40:08.360
I've had my share of hardship.

642
40:08.440 --> 40:09.880
Now it's time to earn those better days

643
40:09.960 --> 40:11.600
with my own two hands.

644
40:15.640 --> 40:17.280
Just keep it. No need to give it back.

645
40:18.880 --> 40:21.680
Then I'll just sit back and watch you do your thing.

646
40:22.640 --> 40:24.120
But let's get one thing straight.

647
40:24.200 --> 40:25.960
If you don't do a good job,

648
40:26.040 --> 40:27.880
I'll still have your company replace you.

649
40:29.120 --> 40:30.920
-No problem. -Alright.

650
40:31.680 --> 40:32.560
Get back in there.

651
40:37.720 --> 40:38.920
Wait.

652
40:40.960 --> 40:42.200
Let me make one thing clear.

653
40:42.880 --> 40:44.480
I didn't specifically get that thing for you.

654
40:45.080 --> 40:46.560
Everyone in our company has one.

655
40:48.000 --> 40:48.840
I get it.

656
40:49.520 --> 40:50.520
And…

657
40:53.160 --> 40:54.240
I meant what I said.

658
40:54.320 --> 40:55.800
You look good

659
40:58.520 --> 40:59.400
with or without makeup.

660
41:04.480 --> 41:06.840
Our first question covers three main areas.

661
41:06.920 --> 41:10.040
Revenue forecast, cost structure, and break-even.

662
41:10.120 --> 41:11.080
Everyone can take a look.

663
41:11.160 --> 41:13.760
Feel free to ask if you have any questions.

664
41:14.680 --> 41:16.680
Ms. Lin, based on Maxmise's analysis,

665
41:16.760 --> 41:18.040
what's the biggest pain point

666
41:18.120 --> 41:19.760
and challenge in the HR integration

667
41:19.840 --> 41:21.800
between Bolo and Qingyi?

668
41:22.880 --> 41:24.920
The biggest challenge is that

669
41:25.000 --> 41:26.040
getting married is easy, but living together is hard.

670
41:26.640 --> 41:28.320
Let me use a familiar romance drama

671
41:28.400 --> 41:29.480
as an example.

672
41:29.560 --> 41:31.720
Bolo is like a career-driven CEO

673
41:31.800 --> 41:33.080
who lives and breathes KPIs.

674
41:33.160 --> 41:35.720
And Qingyi is like an artistic girl

675
41:35.800 --> 41:37.200
who meditates for three minutes before every meeting.

676
41:37.280 --> 41:39.080
Put two people like that under the same roof

677
41:39.160 --> 41:41.320
after marriage, and the trouble starts.

678
41:42.120 --> 41:43.720
Like, after using the bathroom,

679
41:43.800 --> 41:45.760
should the toilet seat stay up or down?

680
41:49.400 --> 41:51.040
Of course, that's just a metaphor.

681
41:51.120 --> 41:53.840
The book value of a merger is written in the financials.

682
41:53.920 --> 41:55.880
But the real value is hidden in the everyday conversations

683
41:55.960 --> 41:56.920
between organizations.

684
41:57.000 --> 41:59.000
Maxmise's job is to help Bolo and Qingyi

685
41:59.080 --> 42:01.360
find a new organization despite their differences.

686
42:02.960 --> 42:04.080
She's good to go.

687
42:08.200 --> 42:11.560
How are things on the Celestial side? She was just asking about Xu Chi.

688
42:13.040 --> 42:14.520
I can go back to work next week.

689
42:14.600 --> 42:15.920
As for Celestial…

690
42:17.280 --> 42:18.920
Ma Ke and Celestial's IT director

691
42:19.000 --> 42:20.520
are still blaming each other.

692
42:21.280 --> 42:22.800
The investigation won't wrap up anytime soon.

693
42:52.680 --> 42:54.000
What?

694
42:56.880 --> 42:58.680
I…

695
43:00.040 --> 43:02.240
The painting behind you is really nice. I just took a photo.

696
43:14.560 --> 43:15.480
What are you doing?

697
43:16.760 --> 43:17.880
The flowers behind you are nice too.

698
43:18.560 --> 43:19.640
I'm taking a photo.

699
43:23.080 --> 43:24.360
Let me see.

700
43:25.280 --> 43:26.520
Let me see what you took.

701
43:27.920 --> 43:29.800
-No! -It looks great.

702
43:29.880 --> 43:33.640
No! Send it to me. My face looks so puffy in this.

703
43:33.720 --> 43:35.400
Look at mine. Look at the one I took of you.

704
43:36.520 --> 43:38.040
Look what I took for you.

705
43:38.640 --> 43:40.920
You gotta send me that one. I need to edit it.

706
43:41.000 --> 43:42.200
You really take good photos.

707
43:42.280 --> 43:43.520
Okay, I'll send it to you.

708
43:49.400 --> 43:50.600
Let's get down to business.

709
43:51.120 --> 43:54.200
You had me gathering market data on digital collectibles for so long.

710
43:54.280 --> 43:56.040
What are you planning to do to Wen Ruosen?
